{%- comment -%}
  SHARED — helper only, not a view.

  This tab is prepended to every view, so it deliberately contains no `layout` wrapper and no
  `title_bar`: each of the four views supplies its own. The publish linter checks this tab as
  though it were a view, so it reports "Missing title_bar include" and "No layout class
  detected" here. Both are expected. Adding either would give every view two layouts and a
  duplicate title bar.

  Contents: the title-bar icon (captured once and reused by all four views), and the per-render
  variables derived from the plugin's form fields.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%} Runs before every view. Icon, zone helpers, favourite-team resolution. {%- endcomment -%}

