{%- comment -%} show_zones is a boolean field; treat anything but an explicit false as on. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign zones_on = true -%}
{%- if show_zones == false or show_zones == 'false' or show_zones == 'no' -%}
  {%- assign zones_on = false -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Favourite clubs are flagged per row by the transform as `row.fv`, so the views need no
  name matching here. fav_names stays available for debugging.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%} Zone word for the best-placed favourite; the transform labels each one. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign fav_zone_label = '' -%}
{%- if fav -%}{%- assign fav_zone_label = fav.zl -%}{%- endif -%}
